# Local feature plans, implementation notes, and development backlogs.
# The `.dev-notes/` name (dot-prefixed) is the sole convention — a bare
# `dev-notes/` folder should never exist anywhere. Pattern with no leading
# slash matches at any depth, so it also catches `.dev-notes/` inside
# submodules if they don't have their own gitignore for it.
.dev-notes/

